flowchart TD
    A[👑 Admin Logs In] --> B[🏠 Dashboard<br>Sees: ALL features + Settings menu]
    
    B --> C{Choose Action}
    
    C -->|Manage Users| D1[👥 Go to 'Manage Users']
    D1 --> D2[➕ Invite New User<br>Enter Email / Phone]
    D2 --> D3[🎯 Assign Role<br>Manager / Sales / Accountant]
    D3 --> D4[📨 User Receives Invite]
    
    C -->|Run Payroll| E1[💰 Open Payroll Module]
    E1 --> E2[📅 Select Month]
    E2 --> E3[🧮 Calculate Salaries<br>Based on Attendance]
    E3 --> E4[📄 Generate Payslips & Report]
    
    C -->|Backup Company| F1[💾 Open Settings > Backup]
    F1 --> F2[☁️ Create Full Data Backup]
    F2 --> F3[🗑️ Or Restore from Previous]
    
    D4 --> G[🔚 End]
    E4 --> G
    F3 --> G
    
    note right of D3
        ✅ Full Read/Write Access
        ✅ Can Delete everything
        ✅ Can see ALL Reports
        ⚠️ Irreversible actions require 2FA
    end note
    
    style D3 fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b
    style E3 fill:#fff59d,stroke:#f57f17